%% Prospective design: no new military decision, receipt or analytics owner.
flowchart TD
    Need[Current reported rifle requests] --> Query[Existing rifle_supply_view]
    Cycle[Latest named squad refill: existing job IDs] --> Query
    Jobs[Actual completed local issue jobs] --> Query
    Activity[Existing collection / return / operation status] --> Query
    Query --> Batch[One batched current ammunition read; one grouped commitment pass]
    Batch --> Rows[Active need plus recipients of this latest completed named refill]
    Rows --> Reader[Existing ArmySupplyView]
    Stock[Actual local/HQ stock and committed incoming freight] --> Coverage[Explain military shortfall alongside available rear stock]
    Reader --> Coverage
    Coverage --> Panel[Existing coalesced visible panel]
    Panel --> Stable[Retain selected recipient by stable ID after its request clears]
    Stable --> Observe[Observe current friendly recipient; no new order]
    Cycle -->|new cycle| Replace[Follow current cycle and active requests; no growing history store]
    Session[Session replacement] -->|existing lifecycle| Clear[Discard prior rows, actions and selection]
    Receipt[Physical receipt] -. does not imply .-> Victory[Combat success or all other capability restored]
